-- CK-57: an INFINITE TYPE message writes the structure down with the cycle
-- marked — `a = { a | x : a }` — as Elm does (checker-v2.md §8.2: the
-- occurs walk returns the cycle's path, rendered before poisoning). On
-- 7427828 its "best effort at writing it down" is the literal `a  =  … a …`.


f r =
    { r | x = r }
